**
# Allowlist: only runtime code is baked into the image.
# Local Neon profile (~/.config/neon/), .neon, .env, credentials, and host state are never included
# (Cloud Run wake containers receive ONLY pooled runtime URL via Secret Manager;
# direct/owner migration URL is for explicit migrate jobs only).
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!lib/
!lib/**
!bin/
!bin/**
!migrations/
!migrations/**
!container/
!container/entrypoint.sh
